ne 14 pro  well every year we think the apple can't  make the phone that much better and most  years they really surprise us you know  we had promotion last year well now we  have the always on display personally i  think the most game-changing features  are the screen that can get way brighter  in daylight it's a real world usability  feature the safety features with the  satellite connectivity and getting rid  of that notch that is just a nicety it  is a luxury it is not as is not a  necessity basically and as far as the  cameras yes the quality is going to get  better but most people are happy with  their iphone 13 photos or even the 12.  now personally we are going to be doing  a comparison not only a blind one but  we're going to compare the 12 the 13 and  the 14 to show you guys their real world  differences just like we have in  previous years to show you isn't really  that much better for what you do so you  guys can you know subscribe to check  that out uh but overall i think that for  a lot of people if you don't care about  the safety features with the satellite  and if you don't care about the screen  getting brighter some of the camera  improvements you don't really need to  upgrade the phone looks the same your  iphone 13 works well so in that case  it's not huge for me i care about  cameras and i care about display so of  course i'm going to upgrade now if  you're somebody that's coming from an  iphone 12 or even an iphone 11 this is  where you're gonna have a big big  difference  overall and cameras is going to be huge  and screen's going to get huge you're  going to get the pro motion uh the  battery life is a lot better compared to  the iphone 12 in that case i would say  yeah it is a good time to upgrade so you  guys let me know your thoughts down in  the comment section below click above to  subscribe check out one of those great  videos right over there that's been max  and i'll see you in the next video  [Music]

